  "notes": [
    "Complete list: 4 actions in initActions (index.js:66-174), no feedbacks (none defined).",
    "Protocol: raw XML strings over TCP port 9876 (hard-coded, index.js:54) to the config host. The config has the host IP and a 'Target MAC Address', which is used as the Frame id in the multiview layout XML (index.js:85); without it that action sends an empty frame id.",
    "The labels 'Userkey number (sending -1)', 'Screen Destination (sending -1)' and 'Layer (sending -1)' mean: the callback parses the text with parseInt and subtracts 1 before sending, so the user enters 1-based numbers (index.js:150-152). Non-numeric text yields NaN in the XML.",
    "audioTone destination ids '0'..'3' are inserted unquoted as the XML id attribute value (index.js:118).",
    "The XML bodies contain fixed GUID attributes copied from the source; Custom XML sends the text unchanged, so any Event Master XML can be sent. The Custom XML field has no variable support.",
    "This is the legacy XML (port 9876) module; barco-eventmaster is the separate JSON-RPC module.",
    "Built on @companion-module/base ~1.12.1: options do not support expressions."
  ]
